# A paragraph longer than a line typed on a phone and sent: it breaks into lines one way in the field and another in
# its message, each piece going from where it was typed to where the message has it (sfbase flight.mbt).
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 帮我看一下登录按钮在深色模式下的颜色是不是不对，还有注册页输入框的边框也要再核对一遍
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1500
exit
